    title: "文献总表 CSV（152 行 × 27 列，含逐篇 DOI/PMID 与证据级别）"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/Elephenman/protein-design-screening-reference"
    path: "data/protein_design_literature.csv"
  - type: dataset
    title: "工作流证据台账（152 行，机器抽取，含两个证据口径）"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/Elephenman/protein-design-screening-reference"
    path: "deliverables/protein_design_workflow_evidence.csv"
  - type: dataset
    title: "判据拆分台账（679 行）"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/Elephenman/protein-design-screening-reference"
